WEBVTT

00:03.040 --> 00:04.520
Our army has sufficient supplies

00:04.600 --> 00:06.000
This hard-won food

00:06.240 --> 00:08.240
You should keep it for yourselves

00:09.480 --> 00:10.600
Take out some grain

00:10.680 --> 00:11.600
Distribute it to everyone

00:11.680 --> 00:13.080
Yes

00:15.440 --> 00:16.600
The villagers' goodwill

00:16.680 --> 00:18.080
I have received it

00:18.440 --> 00:19.720
Great Xuan's goodwill

00:19.800 --> 00:21.200
Please also accept it

